<title>INDIA: India forex reserves stay at $29.34 bln on July 4.</title>
<headline>India forex reserves stay at $29.34 bln on July 4.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's foreign exchange reserves remained steady at $29.34 billion on July 4, the same figure as a week earlier, the Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said in its weekly statistical supplement on Monday.  </p>
<p>.</p>
<p>	 Foreign exchange reserves (in million U.S. dollars)</p>
<p>					  June 27     June 27	June 28</p>
<p>					   1997	  1997	   1996</p>
<p>    Foreign currency assets     25,409	25,387	17,527</p>
<p>    Gold				 3,924	 3,954	 4,509</p>
<p>    SDRs				     3	     3	   128</p>
<p>    Total			     29,336	29,344	22,164</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
